{"id":"27fab6bb26120749","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-diagonal-representable.md","title":"Diagonal Function Representable","display":"lem-diagonal-representable — Diagonal Function Representable","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-diagonal-representable","aliases":["92-lem-diagonal-representable"],"display":"lem-diagonal-representable — Diagonal Function Representable","depends_on":["[[92-df-diagonal-function]]","[[92-df-representable]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-fact-diagonal-computable]]","[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-thm-representability]]","[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-substitution]]","[[92-df-numeral]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）","source_status":"原书表示性思想的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-diagonal-representable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-diagonal-representable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-diagonal-representable — Diagonal Function Representable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6ad30e82597031a6\" href=\"?note=6ad30e82597031a6\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-function\">92-df-diagonal-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"659d57dcf656b1a5\" href=\"?note=659d57dcf656b1a5\" title=\"92-fact-diagonal-computable\">92-fact-diagonal-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0b2170bf5b3075ce\" href=\"?note=0b2170bf5b3075ce\" title=\"92-thm-representability\">92-thm-representability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"725c1f1651ce9a00\" href=\"?note=725c1f1651ce9a00\" title=\"92-df-substitution\">92-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书表示性思想的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> (diagonal function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"6ad30e82597031a6\" href=\"?note=6ad30e82597031a6\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-function\">92-df-diagonal-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\widehat d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (total recursive extension of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"659d57dcf656b1a5\" href=\"?note=659d57dcf656b1a5\" title=\"92-fact-diagonal-computable\">92-fact-diagonal-computable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (pairing encoder, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_d\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(D_d\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (encoded graph of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat d\">\\(\\widehat d\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0,v_1\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(v_0,v_1\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subst}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Subst}_G\\)</span> (distinguished variables and capture-avoiding substitution)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetic-strength assumption, using <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> (representability predicate in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_d\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\delta_d\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (candidate internal binary graph formula)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\nD_d\\coloneqq\\{J(n,\\widehat d(n))\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Rep}_G(D_d)\\land\n\\exists\\delta_d\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\delta_d)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nG\\vdash\\forall v_1\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\delta_d,\\bar n,v_0)\n\\leftrightarrow v_1=\\overline{\\widehat d(n)}\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}representable}\\vdash\nD_d\\coloneqq\\{J(n,\\widehat d(n))\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\},\n\\qquad Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Rep}_G(D_d)\\land\n\\exists\\delta_d\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\delta_d)\\subseteq\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\nG\\vdash\\forall v_1\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Subst}_G(\\delta_d,\\bar n,v_0)\n\\leftrightarrow v_1=\\overline{\\widehat d(n)}\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> : 对角化函数 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"6ad30e82597031a6\" href=\"?note=6ad30e82597031a6\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-function\">92-df-diagonal-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span>在本书中作用于自然数集合，所以<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_d\">\\(D_d\\)</span>是对角函数的配对编码图，而不是把函数直接送入集合谓词</li>\n<li>固定点构造还需要可放进对象公式的二元图公式<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_d\">\\(\\delta_d\\)</span>；第二个合取显式给出其强单值表示性质，不能把外部集合<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_d\">\\(D_d\\)</span>直接写成<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_d(v_0,v_1)\">\\(D_d(v_0,v_1)\\)</span></li>\n<li>对角函数的全扩张递归，因此其图关系可在包含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>的算术系统中按numeral强表示；这里把集合型表示和二元内部表示分开记录</li>\n<li>这是证明对角化引理的关键步骤</li>\n<li>Smullyan强调这个引理的技术重要性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本条中的旧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rep}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Rep}_G\\)</span> 仍表示正负数码定义。强可定义函数另有内部唯一输出条件，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"be5eece035332f0c\" href=\"?note=be5eece035332f0c\" title=\"92-df-strongly-definable-function\">92-df-strongly-definable-function</a>；仅配对图码可定义不能直接省去该条件。原书对角函数强可定义性在 p. 102 的 Proposition 4 明确给出。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VIII 章 pp. 97–102（PDF 114–119）。</p>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-diagonal-function","status":"resolved","id":"6ad30e82597031a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-diagonal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-representable","status":"resolved","id":"d9d845f6cd765d21","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-representable